#: ../../menu_descriptions/menu_lighttable.rst:132
msgid ""
"See description in the :ref:`Main Window <menu_mainimport>` section about "
"Import plugins."
msgstr ""
"Описание модулей импорта приведено в разделе :ref:`Главное окно "
"<menu_mainimport>`."

#: ../../menu_descriptions/menu_lighttable.rst:135
msgid "The Export Menu"
msgstr "Меню «Экспорт»"

#: ../../menu_descriptions/menu_lighttable.rst:137
msgid ""
"See description in the :ref:`Main Window <menu_mainexport>` section about "
